  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Thank you, Sofia. Your identity is verified, and I've looked at order O-5111.\n\nThe berry smoothie ($6.75) is listed on the order, but the delivery record shows the Harvest bowl only. I can't issue a refund or credit for it myself, because your account has had several refunds in the last 30 days. I've passed the case to a human specialist (reference ESC-700), who will follow up with you within 24 hours. I've noted that the smoothie has been missing from your orders before, and that you'd like it resolved, which will help them review it.\n\nWhen the specialist contacts you, they can go over your options for the smoothie. Is there anything else I can help you with today?"
