   "text": "I understand the frustration, and I'm not doubting you. The smoothie was on your order and didn't arrive, and it's reasonable to want that fixed quickly.\n\nI'm still not able to refund it myself. Accounts with several refunds in the last 30 days have to be reviewed by a specialist before any money is returned, and that's the case with yours. ESC-700 is already with a specialist, who will follow up within 24 hours. I can't promise the outcome, but they'll have the full details: the order, the missing smoothie, and your request for the $6.75 back on your Visa ending 4242.\n\nIf you'd rather speak with a person directly, just say so and I'll note that in the case as well."
